  "worked_solution": "Using the linearity and additivity of double integrals, we get the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\u222c}_{C\\cup D}\\frac{f(x,y)}{2}\\text{\u00a0}\\text{d}A & =\\frac{1}{2}{\u222c}_{C\\cup D}f(x,y)\\text{\u00a0}\\text{d}A \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}({\u222c}_{C}f(x,y)\\text{\u00a0}\\text{d}A+{\u222c}_{D}f(x,y)\\text{\u00a0}\\text{d}A) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{3}{2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
